  "term": "sexual addiction",
  "definition": "Sexual addiction refers to a persistent inability to control intense, repeated sexual urges or impulses that leads to repetitive sexual behavior. The behavior may become a central focus of life, continue despite harmful consequences or little satisfaction, and resist repeated efforts to reduce it.",
